# One play session

Never open Simple Browser / cursor-ide-browser to MV2 (`:8765`,
`paulooventura.github.io/MV2`, `index.html?ab=`). Hidden Cursor tabs keep
playing BGM after the user closes every window they can see.

Do not start `python -m http.server`, extra `PLAY.bat`, or a second play tab
unless the user asked to play **and** nothing is already on 8765.

Use `npm run selftest` for QA. If 8765 is taken: `scripts/stop-play.ps1` first.
`play-local.mjs` must not open a browser unless `MV_PLAY_OPEN=1`.
